    "profile_notes": "Description: This print profile is optimized for the Cat Food Pouch Scraper , fine-tuned for smooth, reliable, and efficient printing on Bambu printers. Adjusted infill pattern and density – balanced for strength, flexibility, and reduced print time. Refined print speeds and retractions – improved flow control and minimized stringing for cleaner surfaces. Modified top and bottom layers – adjusted for better surface quality and consistent layer bonding. Three perimeter walls – added for enhanced durability and stiffness. Overall tuning for easy printing – stable and efficient setup suitable for everyday PLA use. These adjustments result in a clean, strong print with excellent surface finish and reliable adhesion. Thanks to the original designer for sharing this practical model!",
